      "id": "solve",
      "sourceKeyAttribute": "Solve",
      "labels": {
        "en": "Solve",
        "es": "Resolver"
      },
      "definitions": {
        "en": "To solve the problem is another way of finding the answer. To find out what 2 + 3 is, you have to add. Adding is how you solve the problem.",
        "es": "Resolver el problema es otra manera de encontrar la respuesta. Para saber cuánto es 2 + 3, usted tiene que sumar. Sumar es la forma de resolver el problema."
